  "description": "A bizarre martial art that commands Jiangshi—Flame Demon Arts.\nThe Jinju Eon Family was wiped out by the Murim Alliance for the crime of stealing the Flame Demon Arts.\nNow, the family’s sole survivor, Eon Jugeon, sets out to hunt down the murderer who wields the very same forbidden technique.\n\n***Note about Title:** An Arhat (羅漢) is a Buddhist enlightened being who has attained nirvana, often depicted as a master of wisdom and martial arts.*\n\n[Pre-serialization](https://comic.naver.com/bestChallenge/list?titleId=815845) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=837468), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12340212)",
